      "text": "Users\nHotels\nRooms\nBookings",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Users\nHotels\nRooms\nBookings",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "okh2s9u3tqXYreWNvr4mn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16942.14626468751,
      "y": 46454.05939478284,
      "width": 1475.7388916015625,
      "height": 455,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b11",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1414508063,
      "version": 2869,
      "versionNonce": 1160237998,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779771976455,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Guest :\n\n1. POST : /v1/users/register {postBody: userMetaData} + (login/logout/update)\n2. GET: /v1/hotels/search?q={name}&l={location}&d={date} -> List<HotelId (Partial)>: Pagination\n3. GET: /v1/hotels/{hotelId}/{date} -> MetaData of hotel ( available rooms + review + ... )\n4. POST: /v1/bookings/reserve {postBody: hotelId, roomId, date} ->  {reservationId, amount} (reserver room endpoint)\n    POST: /v1/payments/initiate  {reservationId, amount, method}  ->  token   (payment initialiazaiton)\n                client use this token to make payment uysing selected method\n                once payment is done it returns signature \n    POST: /v1/payments/callback  {paymentId, reservationId, status, transactionId, signature}       (verfies payemnt)\n                it verifies signature and mark payment as confirms / failed. \n                base on that update room availibilty status.\n5. GET: /v1/bookings/{userId} : List of all the booking.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Guest :\n\n1. POST : /v1/users/register {postBody: userMetaData} + (login/logout/update)\n2. GET: /v1/hotels/search?q={name}&l={location}&d={date} -> List<HotelId (Partial)>: Pagination\n3. GET: /v1/hotels/{hotelId}/{date} -> MetaData of hotel ( available rooms + review + ... )\n4. POST: /v1/bookings/reserve {postBody: hotelId, roomId, date} ->  {reservationId, amount} (reserver room endpoint)\n    POST: /v1/payments/initiate  {reservationId, amount, method}  ->  token   (payment initialiazaiton)\n                client use this token to make payment uysing selected method\n                once payment is done it returns signature \n    POST: /v1/payments/callback  {paymentId, reservationId, status, transactionId, signature}       (verfies payemnt)\n                it verifies signature and mark payment as confirms / failed. \n                base on that update room availibilty status.\n5. GET: /v1/bookings/{userId} : List of all the booking.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "kdEZTnmwARSDgWbxNw5ga",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 18464.723908854212,
      "y": 46348.05939500107,
      "width": 1317.3115234375,
      "height": 405,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bELzt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 476120913,
      "version": 1140,
      "versionNonce": 1972454801,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779735683757,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirement:\n\n\nGuest\n- User should be able to create account in our application\n- User should able to search hotels based on location & name\n- User should be able to book a particular room on the hotel based on availability\n- User should be able to make the payment and confirm the booking\n- View past booking details in his profile",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirement:\n\n\nGuest\n- User should be able to create account in our application\n- User should able to search hotels based on location & name\n- User should be able to book a particular room on the hotel based on availability\n- User should be able to make the payment and confirm the booking\n- View past booking details in his profile",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "AImWInAxnLq8HxD8s2F_o",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 18464.723908520875,
      "y": 47023.05939500107,
      "width": 977.6876831054688,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bELzv",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1496263647,
      "version": 1213,
      "versionNonce": 179354943,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779735690053,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirement:\n\n\nProperty Owner\n- Host should be able to login / signup\n- Host should be able to add or update their property\n- Host should be able to upload property images\n- Host should be able to set price, location, availability, rules\n- Host should be able to view and manage bookings\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirement:\n\n\nProperty Owner\n- Host should be able to login / signup\n- Host should be able to add or update their property\n- Host should be able to upload property images\n- Host should be able to set price, location, availability, rules\n- Host should be able to view and manage bookings\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
