      "updated": 1779729267069,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 1: Requirements",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 1: Requirements",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "a02z-ZpBv2ktZUB2egAqu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16209.788830540634,
      "y": 42001.10391148608,
      "width": 1317.3115234375,
      "height": 675,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bSy",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1624343967,
      "version": 1098,
      "versionNonce": 593461471,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779742164208,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirement:\n\nProperty Owner\n- Host should be able to login / signup\n- Host should be able to add or update their property\n- Host should be able to upload property images\n- Host should be able to set price, location, availability, rules\n- Host should be able to view and manage bookings\n\nGuest\n- User should be able to create account in our application\n- User should able to search hotels based on location & name\n- User should be able to book a particular room on the hotel based on availability\n- User should be able to make the payment and confirm the booking\n- View past booking details in his profile",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirement:\n\nProperty Owner\n- Host should be able to login / signup\n- Host should be able to add or update their property\n- Host should be able to upload property images\n- Host should be able to set price, location, availability, rules\n- Host should be able to view and manage bookings\n\nGuest\n- User should be able to create account in our application\n- User should able to search hotels based on location & name\n- User should be able to book a particular room on the hotel based on availability\n- User should be able to make the payment and confirm the booking\n- View past booking details in his profile",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "paG0NMtbm9CWtwVMOGv1T",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17664.24849909155,
      "y": 42005.44122353476,
      "width": 999.935546875,
      "height": 810,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bSz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2028829119,
      "version": 875,
      "versionNonce": 1454088721,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779729267069,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-Functional Requirement:\n- Scale: 50M users, 1M Hotels\n\nGuest:\n- CAP Theorem: Availability >>> consistency (99.9999%)\n- Application should be highly available based on searching.\nAnd our application should be highly consistent based on \nbooking of room, means no two users should be able to book \nthe same room on same date \n\nProperty Owners:\n- Highly Available\n- Easily Scalable\n\nHigh availability:\n    Fault tolerance\n    Rate limiting\n    Observability",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-Functional Requirement:\n- Scale: 50M users, 1M Hotels\n\nGuest:\n- CAP Theorem: Availability >>> consistency (99.9999%)\n- Application should be highly available based on searching.\nAnd our application should be highly consistent based on \nbooking of room, means no two users should be able to book \nthe same room on same date \n\nProperty Owners:\n- Highly Available\n- Easily Scalable\n\nHigh availability:\n    Fault tolerance\n    Rate limiting\n    Observability",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
