      "versionNonce": 520288607,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779731064037,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "data coming in per second    =     10.35GB  / 100K \n                                                \n                                                       0.1035MB / second\n\nwith peak traffic 10x            = 1MB / sec",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "data coming in per second    =     10.35GB  / 100K \n                                                \n                                                       0.1035MB / second\n\nwith peak traffic 10x            = 1MB / sec",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "OLAntKLOyjUSiHwCglUOP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17493.49317897023,
      "y": 45798.11691096796,
      "width": 1030.259033203125,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bUc",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 786135153,
      "version": 1586,
      "versionNonce": 540702079,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779731064037,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "all read request is what data going out of system\nread s per second = 150M\nand avg size of response = 100kb (images will be serve through cdn)\n\ndata going out per day  =  150M * 100KB       =      15000 GB / day    =  15TB / day",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "all read request is what data going out of system\nread s per second = 150M\nand avg size of response = 100kb (images will be serve through cdn)\n\ndata going out per day  =  150M * 100KB       =      15000 GB / day    =  15TB / day",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GFJPPGJj_ZzvDUYA4TOSK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17489.38233323572,
      "y": 46004.17193619824,
      "width": 1037.9310302734375,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
