      "updated": 1779729267071,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "so total property owner  =  10m / 50  =  200k owners \nand rest are guests  =  10m - 200k  = 9.8m guests",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "so total property owner  =  10m / 50  =  200k owners \nand rest are guests  =  10m - 200k  = 9.8m guests",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "zII5i_ae_dnLYJOoqbCQr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16346.686705161292,
      "y": 43737.771332858974,
      "width": 599.1156005859375,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bUk",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1201431249,
      "version": 229,
      "versionNonce": 871265009,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779729267071,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "assume every property owner update or create \nproperty once a week\nand also assume each guest book a property \nonce a month",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "assume every property owner update or create \nproperty once a week\nand also assume each guest book a property \nonce a month",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "evOwOSWcrJAWlUnjQ1UpF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16345.537420784356,
      "y": 44112.728395198246,
      "width": 747.7673950195312,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bUm",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1402690015,
      "version": 419,
      "versionNonce": 275049681,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779729267071,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "average write thorugput is  350K / 100K  =   4 write req/sec",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "average write thorugput is  350K / 100K  =   4 write req/sec",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "86sXMaJdX5EnEw2r6SNdb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16352.216369216707,
      "y": 44038.55185626947,
      "width": 246.09185791015625,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bUo",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2002910481,
      "version": 183,
      "versionNonce": 1873881777,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779729267071,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Total = 20K + 330K",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Total = 20K + 330K",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "w7o2WxktdGvWCur_Duhnt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16350.211527841035,
      "y": 43920.5647552474,
      "width": 510.32769775390625,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bUp",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1771480657,
      "version": 117,
      "versionNonce": 2054859921,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779729267071,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "200k / 10       =       20k write req / day\n9.8M / 30       =       0.33M write req / day",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "200k / 10       =       20k write req / day\n9.8M / 30       =       0.33M write req / day",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "IezVm4gr2SeCZu3AjCtjS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16342.09399221832,
      "y": 44186.944695881175,
      "width": 495.01165771484375,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bUr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1626946897,
      "version": 95,
      "versionNonce": 1484321393,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779729267071,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "10x peak traffic \nthrouput is 4 * 10 =    40 write req / sec",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "10x peak traffic \nthrouput is 4 * 10 =    40 write req / sec",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jGiwLzzhText4SbBrM7nr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17195.530717489382,
      "y": 43612.77133270028,
      "width": 506.127685546875,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bUs",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1829985521,
      "version": 24,
      "versionNonce": 1316191313,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779729267071,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Assume every guest:\n- searches property 5 times/day\n- views 10 property pages/day\n\nAssume every property owner:\n- checks booking/dashboard 5 times/day\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Assume every guest:\n- searches property 5 times/day\n- views 10 property pages/day\n\nAssume every property owner:\n- checks booking/dashboard 5 times/day\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_qLqtDKxK4JMlOMfC6mXP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17198.24416598289,
      "y": 43880.74072215622,
      "width": 768.54345703125,
      "height": 280,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bUt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1423429745,
      "version": 203,
      "versionNonce": 474073649,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779729267071,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Guest search reads:                    9.8M * 5 = 49M read req/day\nGuest property detail reads:     9.8M * 10 = 98M read req/day\nOwner dashboard reads:           200K * 5 = 1M read req/day\n\nTotal:        49M + 98M + 1M =  ~150M read req/day\n\nPer second:           150M / 86400    =  ~1.7K read req/sec\nWith 10x peak:    1.7K * 10             =  ~17K read req/sec",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Guest search reads:                    9.8M * 5 = 49M read req/day\nGuest property detail reads:     9.8M * 10 = 98M read req/day\nOwner dashboard reads:           200K * 5 = 1M read req/day\n\nTotal:        49M + 98M + 1M =  ~150M read req/day\n\nPer second:           150M / 86400    =  ~1.7K read req/sec\nWith 10x peak:    1.7K * 10             =  ~17K read req/sec",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "csvcCfoyUUuB4r76TumdF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16826.1652588354,
      "y": 44378.713326799276,
      "width": 295.31591796875,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bUu",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1805160287,
      "version": 226,
      "versionNonce": 449534993,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779729267071,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Average QPS:\nRead QPS + Write QPS\n= 1.7K + 4\n= ~1.7K QPS\n= ~2K QPS",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Average QPS:\nRead QPS + Write QPS\n= 1.7K + 4\n= ~1.7K QPS\n= ~2K QPS",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ExsCeL-B93AFE9juAxFA0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17207.292522009586,
      "y": 44378.7133267928,
      "width": 432.5158386230469,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bUv",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1078673791,
      "version": 128,
      "versionNonce": 436711921,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779729267071,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Peak QPS:\nPeak Read QPS + Peak Write QPS\n= 17K + 40\n= ~17K QPS\n= ~20K QPS",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Peak QPS:\nPeak Read QPS + Peak Write QPS\n= 17K + 40\n= ~17K QPS\n= ~20K QPS",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "q5Jr72wfmoSyiTpixabI9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16280.677369148834,
      "y": 44822.14742224248,
      "width": 751.9954833984375,
      "height": 420,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bUw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 312381041,
      "version": 308,
      "versionNonce": 2054518943,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779729868491,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Property data :\n\nassume each property data has \ndescription, image, metadata\n   (50kb)     (450kb)    (10kb)\n\nTotal Storage for Property data  =  500kb\n\nfrom write throuput : 20k write req / day for property create\n\ntotal storage per day =    20k * 500kb          =  10GB / day\nstorage for 10 years  =    10GB * 400 * 10   =  40TB",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Property data :\n\nassume each property data has \ndescription, image, metadata\n   (50kb)     (450kb)    (10kb)\n\nTotal Storage for Property data  =  500kb\n\nfrom write throuput : 20k write req / day for property create\n\ntotal storage per day =    20k * 500kb          =  10GB / day\nstorage for 10 years  =    10GB * 400 * 10   =  40TB",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HVymdpISJKT-fafYhnKOm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16280.677369148834,
      "y": 45312.26635600286,
      "width": 792.7073974609375,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bUy",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1644812305,
      "version": 334,
      "versionNonce": 1884848817,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779729804088,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Guest Booking data:\n\nassume each booking has gues info, property deatils and dates\n\nassume total size  =   1kb\n\nfrom write thorughput : 0.33M req / day for boookings\n\ntotal storage per day =    0.33M * 1kb              =  0.35GB / day\nstorage for 10 years  =    0.35GB * 400 * 10    =  1.4TB",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Guest Booking data:\n\nassume each booking has gues info, property deatils and dates\n\nassume total size  =   1kb\n\nfrom write thorughput : 0.33M req / day for boookings\n\ntotal storage per day =    0.33M * 1kb              =  0.35GB / day\nstorage for 10 years  =    0.35GB * 400 * 10    =  1.4TB",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "TAQu4tEW2vKMOMCmL5sJj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16277.021249169602,
      "y": 45730.69323708194,
      "width": 860.04736328125,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bUz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1293982769,
      "version": 218,
      "versionNonce": 1498297105,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779729549793,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Total storage per day  =   10GB/day + 0.35GB/day    =   10.35GB/day\nTotal storage for 10 y  =   40TB    +    1.5TB               =    41.5TB",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Total storage per day  =   10GB/day + 0.35GB/day    =   10.35GB/day\nTotal storage for 10 y  =   40TB    +    1.5TB               =    41.5TB",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
