      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Property Owner:\n\nfor register we will use same endpoint : we will attachg userRole: HOST\n\n1. POST /v1/properties   {...propertiesMetadata}  ->  propertyId\n2. PUT /v1/properties/{propertyId}     ->    udpated property\n3. POST /v1/properties/{propertyId}/images/upload-url     ->   return presigned url (s3)\n    client use that to upload to obj storage directly\n    and then send url of image to server\n4. PUT /v1/properties/{propertyId}/availability       ->   uddate availibity\n5. PUT /v1/properties/{propertyId}/pricing              ->   udpate pricing\n6. GET /v1/hosts/{hostId}/properties?page={page}     ->   view own properties\n7. GET /v1/hosts/{hostId}/bookings?page={page}       ->   view bookings",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Property Owner:\n\nfor register we will use same endpoint : we will attachg userRole: HOST\n\n1. POST /v1/properties   {...propertiesMetadata}  ->  propertyId\n2. PUT /v1/properties/{propertyId}     ->    udpated property\n3. POST /v1/properties/{propertyId}/images/upload-url     ->   return presigned url (s3)\n    client use that to upload to obj storage directly\n    and then send url of image to server\n4. PUT /v1/properties/{propertyId}/availability       ->   uddate availibity\n5. PUT /v1/properties/{propertyId}/pricing              ->   udpate pricing\n6. GET /v1/hosts/{hostId}/properties?page={page}     ->   view own properties\n7. GET /v1/hosts/{hostId}/bookings?page={page}       ->   view bookings",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
