      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779808166767,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Geo Hash\n\nits similar to quad tree: we subdivide this world map \nIn geohash, we also divide the whole world map into small-small grids.\nBut here, instead of storing it like a big tree, we give each grid a string value.\nThat string is called geohash.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Geo Hash\n\nits similar to quad tree: we subdivide this world map \nIn geohash, we also divide the whole world map into small-small grids.\nBut here, instead of storing it like a big tree, we give each grid a string value.\nThat string is called geohash.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
