    {
      "id": "_skbHbiUBthqxveNg6Uwg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 24261.69265165182,
      "y": 48909.093472762055,
      "width": 1062.26318359375,
      "height": 420,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "A5bUPhBSFzz9-CoSwAifb",
        "DE77SXX6KpuR19jWmqmrh",
        "K0x2oBap-Gtcf4fdB1VNH",
        "yH_6nJM9zWQ3lXhNFvPT8",
        "VUC7AFic4neijwuood9F7",
        "avU27ZgV4Ni1Ag53chbX6"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bdg",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1838182382,
      "version": 659,
      "versionNonce": 972163347,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779808166767,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "it keeps dividing. \nthe larger the string is better accuracy.\n\nthis string is ntg but called as geo hash\n\nthis is better than quad tree coz:\n\nOne restaurant may have geohash like:                         tdr1w9\nAnother nearby restaurant may have geohash like:     tdr1wk\nSo nearby places usually have similar starting characters.\n\nto get all near by places you just have to change last character. Prefix remains same.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "it keeps dividing. \nthe larger the string is better accuracy.\n\nthis string is ntg but called as geo hash\n\nthis is better than quad tree coz:\n\nOne restaurant may have geohash like:                         tdr1w9\nAnother nearby restaurant may have geohash like:     tdr1wk\nSo nearby places usually have similar starting characters.\n\nto get all near by places you just have to change last character. Prefix remains same.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xb6pnkXvDoH1XHsvLMkcn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 24255.637096096267,
      "y": 49371.31569498427,
      "width": 846.1314086914062,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "A5bUPhBSFzz9-CoSwAifb",
        "DE77SXX6KpuR19jWmqmrh",
        "K0x2oBap-Gtcf4fdB1VNH",
        "yH_6nJM9zWQ3lXhNFvPT8",
        "VUC7AFic4neijwuood9F7",
        "avU27ZgV4Ni1Ag53chbX6"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bdh",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1551036910,
      "version": 414,
      "versionNonce": 484246941,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779808166767,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "search working:\nFirst, we take latitude and longitude of a place.\nUsing that latitude and longitude, we generate one geohash string.\nThis geohash tells us in which grid that restaurant is present.\nMore length of geohash means more precision.\nLess length of geohash means bigger area.\n\nUser location geohash is: tdr1w\nThen nearby restaurants may have geohash starting with: tdr1w\nor nearby geohash values.\nSo we can simply query database like:\n\nWHERE geohash LIKE 'tdr1w%'\n\nThis will give restaurants present in that area.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "search working:\nFirst, we take latitude and longitude of a place.\nUsing that latitude and longitude, we generate one geohash string.\nThis geohash tells us in which grid that restaurant is present.\nMore length of geohash means more precision.\nLess length of geohash means bigger area.\n\nUser location geohash is: tdr1w\nThen nearby restaurants may have geohash starting with: tdr1w\nor nearby geohash values.\nSo we can simply query database like:\n\nWHERE geohash LIKE 'tdr1w%'\n\nThis will give restaurants present in that area.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
