      "updated": 1779808166767,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "it is simpliest one.\nyou dont have to even add any sort of extension like you did in prev one. (postgress gis)\nlocation base searching capability is there by deafult in this algo.\nElasticsearch has built-in support for geo-location search.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "it is simpliest one.\nyou dont have to even add any sort of extension like you did in prev one. (postgress gis)\nlocation base searching capability is there by deafult in this algo.\nElasticsearch has built-in support for geo-location search.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
