    {
      "id": "h32_hyXCA3uVrH92XktaS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23060.805891024433,
      "y": 50923.08438492543,
      "width": 942.4683894360276,
      "height": 735,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "K0x2oBap-Gtcf4fdB1VNH",
        "yH_6nJM9zWQ3lXhNFvPT8",
        "VUC7AFic4neijwuood9F7",
        "avU27ZgV4Ni1Ag53chbX6"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "beU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2019617853,
      "version": 247,
      "versionNonce": 731776435,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779808166767,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Payment svc calls external Payment Gateway.\n\nSince Payment Gateway is a third-party dependency, we will use Circuit\nBreaker pattern here.\n\nIf Payment Gateway starts failing or response time becomes very high,\ncircuit breaker will open.\n\nWhen circuit is open:\n    payment svc will not keep calling payment gateway again and again\n    request will fail fast or return \"payment temporarily unavailable\"\n    this protects our system from thread exhaustion and cascading failure\n\nAfter some cooldown time,\ncircuit breaker goes into half-open state and allows a few test requests.\n\nIf those requests succeed:\n    circuit closes again\n\nIf they fail:\n    circuit remains open",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Payment svc calls external Payment Gateway.\n\nSince Payment Gateway is a third-party dependency, we will use Circuit Breaker pattern here.\n\nIf Payment Gateway starts failing or response time becomes very high,\ncircuit breaker will open.\n\nWhen circuit is open:\n    payment svc will not keep calling payment gateway again and again\n    request will fail fast or return \"payment temporarily unavailable\"\n    this protects our system from thread exhaustion and cascading failure\n\nAfter some cooldown time,\ncircuit breaker goes into half-open state and allows a few test requests.\n\nIf those requests succeed:\n    circuit closes again\n\nIf they fail:\n    circuit remains open",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "C5sqRSezohmBpHNRtdR8W",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 24312.4129670672,
      "y": 45091.74042393661,
      "width": 929.5993041992188,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "VUC7AFic4neijwuood9F7",
        "avU27ZgV4Ni1Ag53chbX6"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "beV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2010182333,
      "version": 104,
      "versionNonce": 1769251581,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779808166767,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Search svc calls Elasticsearch for hotel search.\n\nWe can use Circuit Breaker between Search svc and Elasticsearch.\n\nIf Elasticsearch is slow or unavailable:\n    circuit breaker opens\n    search svc can fail fast\n    or return cached/popular search results from Redis cache\n\nThis prevents Search svc from waiting too long and exhausting resources.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Search svc calls Elasticsearch for hotel search.\n\nWe can use Circuit Breaker between Search svc and Elasticsearch.\n\nIf Elasticsearch is slow or unavailable:\n    circuit breaker opens\n    search svc can fail fast\n    or return cached/popular search results from Redis cache\n\nThis prevents Search svc from waiting too long and exhausting resources.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6tX-cAUJrV11UoLujZdcN",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 23032.40182590914,
      "y": 51765.08747192667,
      "width": 734.8447367655172,
      "height": 75.48528855388582,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "ii-FjtW2FY8OekXUPBcpb",
        "avU27ZgV4Ni1Ag53chbX6"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "beW",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 729060115,
